## Relationship to sibling repository

This course teaches the **model and prompt layer** of AI security (jailbreak
techniques, prompt-injection defences, red-team automation). It is the
pedagogical companion to
[`harmless-harnesses`](https://github.com/Benjamin-KY/Harmless-Harnesses),
which teaches the **structural-harness layer** (governance scaffolding around
the model). Both repositories share the same dual-license split (Apache-2.0
for code, CC BY-SA 4.0 for content); content adapted between the two carries
the same attribution chain.
